# QA-003: A titrated aliquot represents the stock only after volume correction
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 200mL
add v1 HCl 0.002mol
new
decant v1 v2 0.25
measure v1 volume
measure v2 volume
titrate v1 NaOH 0.1M 0.1mL until ph 7 max 200
titrate v2 NaOH 0.1M 0.1mL until ph 7 max 100
inspect
